# Copy to .env and fill in from Supabase → Project Settings → API.
#
# Both values are inlined into the JS bundle at build time and ship inside the
# app, so neither is a secret. Row Level Security is what actually protects the
# data. Never put the service_role key in this file.
#
# Env vars are read at bundle time, so restart with `npx expo start --clear`
# after changing them.

